Package: rungekutta
Title: Solving Ordinary Differential Equations with the Fourth-Order Runge-Kutta Method
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("CHRISTIAN", "DJEUGFANG", email = "cken4840@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements Euler's method and the classical fourth-order
    Runge-Kutta method (RK4) to solve ordinary differential equations and
    systems of equations. Includes a ready-to-use SIR epidemic model and
    plotting functions based on 'ggplot2'.
